  "notes": "{輝|かがや}く means to shine, sparkle, or be radiant, often with a sense of brilliance or glory.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No transitive pair (use ⟦{光|ひか}らせる→光る：01163_hikaru⟧)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{輝|かがや}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes an ongoing state of shining: ⟦{星|ほし}→星：01510_hoshi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{輝|かがや}いて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (the stars are shining).\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n- PHYSICAL: ⟦{星|ほし}→星：01510_hoshi⟧, ⟦{宝石|ほうせき}→宝石：03619_houseki⟧, ⟦{光|ひかり}→光：01707_hikari⟧ shining\n- FIGURATIVE: ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{輝|かがや}く (eyes sparkle), {輝|かがや}く⟦{未来|みらい}→未来：03748_mirai⟧ (bright future)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{輝|かがや}き→輝き：21706_kagayaki⟧: brilliance, radiance (noun)\n- ⟦{光|ひか}る→光る：01163_hikaru⟧: to shine (more common, simpler)\n- ⟦きらめく→きらめく：07677_kirameku⟧: to glitter, twinkle\n\nUSAGE:\n{輝|かがや}く suggests more brilliance and grandeur than ⟦{光|ひか}る→光る：01163_hikaru⟧.",
